{"seq":1,"slug":"a-model-of-computation","title":"图灵机：一种计算的模型","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/alan-turing/core-contributions/the-turing-machine/a-model-of-computation","wordCount":1388,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"图灵机-一种计算的模型\">图灵机：一种计算的模型</h1><p>一九三六年，二十四岁的图灵在伦敦数学会会刊上发表了《论可计算数，及其在判定问题上的应用》（On Computable Numbers, with an Application to the Entscheidungsproblem）。在这篇论文里，他没有去造一台真实的机器，而是设计了一种纸上的、想象中的装置——后人称之为&quot;图灵机&quot;。它的目的不是算得快，而是把&quot;什么叫做按部就班地算&quot;这件直觉上人人都懂、却从未被精确定义过的事，第一次写成了严格的数学。</p>\n<p>图灵的出发点很朴素：观察一个人用纸笔做计算。这个人盯着纸上某一格的符号，根据自己当下的心理状态决定写下什么、看向哪里、心境如何变化。图灵把这套行为抽象到极致，去掉了纸的二维、去掉了人的灵感，只留下机械可执行的部分。剩下的，就是图灵机。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一台图灵机由几个极简的部件构成：一条向两端无限延伸、被划分成方格的纸带；每格可写一个来自有限字母表的符号（包括&quot;空白&quot;）；一个能在纸带上左右移动、并能读写当前格的读写头；一组有限的内部状态；以及一张转移表，规定&quot;在某状态、读到某符号&quot;时机器该怎么做。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  S[内部状态&lt;br/&gt;有限个 q0 q1 …] --&gt; R[读写头&lt;br/&gt;读当前格符号]&#10;  R --&gt; T{转移函数 δ&lt;br/&gt;状态×符号}&#10;  T --&gt; W[写新符号]&#10;  T --&gt; M[左移/右移]&#10;  T --&gt; N[转入新状态]&#10;  W --&gt; TP[无限纸带&lt;br/&gt;…□1011□…]&#10;  M --&gt; TP\">flowchart LR\n  S[内部状态&lt;br/&gt;有限个 q0 q1 …] --&gt; R[读写头&lt;br/&gt;读当前格符号]\n  R --&gt; T{转移函数 δ&lt;br/&gt;状态×符号}\n  T --&gt; W[写新符号]\n  T --&gt; M[左移/右移]\n  T --&gt; N[转入新状态]\n  W --&gt; TP[无限纸带&lt;br/&gt;…□1011□…]\n  M --&gt; TP</pre><p>机器的每一步都完全由&quot;当前状态 + 读写头下的符号&quot;这一对组合决定，没有任何含糊或随机。把这台机器和真实计算机做个对照，更能看清它抽象掉了什么：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>真实计算机</th>\n<th>图灵机</th>\n<th>抽象的用意</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>有限内存（GB 量级）</td>\n<td>无限长纸带</td>\n<td>不让内存大小成为&quot;能不能算&quot;的障碍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复杂指令集</td>\n<td>一张转移表</td>\n<td>证明最朴素的操作已经足够</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时钟频率、缓存</td>\n<td>一步一格，不计时间</td>\n<td>只问&quot;是否可算&quot;，不问&quot;算得快不快&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>寄存器、总线</td>\n<td>单一读写头</td>\n<td>把&quot;读—想—写&quot;压缩成原子动作</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"转移函数-机器的全部-程序\">转移函数：机器的全部&quot;程序&quot;</h2><p>一台具体的图灵机，本质上就是它那张转移表。用数学语言，它是一个转移函数</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>L</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta : Q \\times \\Gamma \\rightarrow Q \\times \\Gamma \\times \\{L, R\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 是有限的状态集合，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span></span></span></span></span> 是纸带字母表，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L, R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 表示读写头左移或右移。这一行公式涵盖了机器能做的一切：读到什么、改写成什么、往哪挪、跳到哪个状态。整台机器可以严格地写成一个七元组</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mtext>accept</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mtext>reject</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M = (Q, \\Sigma, \\Gamma, \\delta, q_0, q_{\\text{accept}}, q_{\\text{reject}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">accept</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reject</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span></span></span></span></span> 是输入字母表，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是起始状态，后两个是接受与拒绝的终止状态。请注意：这里没有一个字提到&quot;理解&quot;&quot;意图&quot;&quot;聪明&quot;——计算被彻底还原为符号的机械搬运。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个能跑起来的例子-在-1-串末尾补一个-1\">一个能跑起来的例子：在 1 串末尾补一个 1</h2><p>抽象的定义容易让人发懵，看一个最小例子就清楚了。设字母表为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">□</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{1, \\square\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">□</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">□</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\square</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.675em;\"></span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">□</span></span></span></span></span> 为空白），纸带上是一串连续的 1，读写头停在最左端。我们要让机器走到这串 1 的右端，再写下一个 1。转移表只需两条状态：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>当前状态</th>\n<th>读到符号</th>\n<th>写入</th>\n<th>移动</th>\n<th>新状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>R</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">□</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\square</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.675em;\"></span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">□</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mtext>accept</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_{\\text{accept}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">accept</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>机器在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 里见 1 就一路右移，直到撞上空白，便把空白改写成 1 并停机。就这么两行规则，完成了&quot;给一元数加一&quot;。把规则堆叠组合，加减乘除、判断素数、排序——一切我们认为&quot;能算&quot;的事，原则上都能用这种规则表搭出来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么这套极简模型如此重要\">为什么这套极简模型如此重要</h2><p>图灵机的力量恰恰来自它的贫乏。它慢得离谱、笨得出奇，却能模拟任何更&quot;高级&quot;的计算装置。这就提出了一个惊人的断言：凡是能被任何机械步骤算出来的东西，都能被这种最简陋的机器算出来。换句话说，图灵机划出了&quot;可计算&quot;的精确边界——边界之内的问题，机器迟早能解；边界之外的，再快的硬件也无能为力。</p>\n<p>这条边界把一个原本只能凭直觉谈论的概念变成了可以证明定理的对象。后来关于&quot;哪些问题永远无解&quot;的深刻结论，全都建立在这个模型之上（详见 <a href=\"the-universal-machine\">通用图灵机</a>）。而图灵机抽象出的&quot;状态 + 存储 + 规则&quot;骨架，也直接预示了后来真实计算机&quot;程序 + 内存&quot;的体系结构（参见 <a href=\"../founding-computer-science/the-father-of-computing\">对计算机科学的奠基</a>）。值得一提的是，仅仅几年之后，图灵就把这套关于&quot;机械可计算&quot;的抽象洞察，投入到了二战期间布莱切利园破译德军密码的实际工程中（见 <a href=\"../../life-and-times/the-war-years/bletchley-park\">战争年代</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>图灵机是 1936 年《论可计算数》中提出的抽象计算模型，目的是精确定义&quot;机械计算&quot;。</li>\n<li>它由无限纸带、读写头、有限状态和一张转移函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 构成，每一步都由&quot;状态+符号&quot;唯一决定。</li>\n<li>一台具体机器就是它的转移表；最小例子（一元数加一）只需两条规则即可运行。</li>\n<li>它的意义不在快，而在划定了&quot;可计算&quot;的精确边界，成为整个计算理论的地基。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"图灵机：一种计算的模型","id":"图灵机-一种计算的模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"转移函数：机器的全部\"程序\"","id":"转移函数-机器的全部-程序"},{"level":2,"text":"一个能跑起来的例子：在 1 串末尾补一个 1","id":"一个能跑起来的例子-在-1-串末尾补一个-1"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么这套极简模型如此重要","id":"为什么这套极简模型如此重要"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"通用图灵机与计算的极限","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/alan-turing/core-contributions/the-turing-machine/the-universal-machine"}}